---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Base title="Lend Ledger | Impact Collective">
  <Header />

  <!-- Section 1: Hero (white background) -->
  <section id="main-content" class="w-full" style="background-color: var(--color-bg-white);">
    <div class="mx-auto px-4" style="max-width: 1012px; padding-top: 87px; padding-bottom: 33px;">
      <h1 class="ledger-h1">LEND LEDGER</h1>
      <p class="ledger-subtitle">
        A free accounting and impact tracking app for Kiva lending chapters
      </p>

      <div class="ledger-body" style="max-width: 683px; margin: 42px auto 0; transform: translateX(26px);">
        <p>
          Lend Ledger is a free app built for student-run Kiva lending chapters. It connects to your Kiva team to pull live lending stats, and gives you a simple ledger to log revenue from your ventures, track how much goes toward microloans, and monitor your chapter's overall impact.
        </p>
        <p style="margin-top: 24px;">
          No spreadsheets, no accounting software, no setup fee. Just download the file, enter your Kiva team ID, and the app configures itself around your chapter in under a minute.
        </p>
        <p>
          Download Lend Ledger and the User Manual below to get started.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex justify-center" style="margin-top: 8px;">
        <a href="/docs/lend-ledger.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="ledger-btn">DOWNLOAD</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section 2: Image strip, inset 80px on lavender -->
  <section class="w-full" style="background-color: var(--color-bg-white); padding: 0 80px;">
    <div style="height: 383px; background-color: var(--color-bg-lavender); background-image: url('https://static.wixstatic.com/media/11062b_dad0a68f8c424ca3984638166091bf3a~mv2.jpg'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;"></div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section 3: Getting Started (lavender background) -->
  <section class="w-full" style="background-color: var(--color-bg-lavender);">
    <div class="mx-auto px-4" style="max-width: 1012px; padding-top: 80px; padding-bottom: 122px;">
      <h2 class="ledger-h2">GETTING STARTED</h2>
      <div class="ledger-rule"></div>

      <div class="ledger-body" style="max-width: 740px; margin: 18px auto 0;">
        <p>This App is fully plug-and-play for any Kiva chapter. Here's how it works:</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 24px;">First launch — setup screen</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 24px;">When you open the file for the first time, you will need to setup screen before the app loads.</p>
        <p>You will fill in four things</p>
        <p>1) Your Chapter name (e.g. "PD Microfinance")</p>
        <p>2) Your Kiva team ID (e.g. pd_microfinance)</p>
        <p>3) Your lending goal with a target date, and the names of their ventures (e.g. Frostbite's Frozen Ice, Curry Kart, Baked)</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 24px;">You click Launch and that's it — the app configures itself around your chapter.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex justify-center" style="margin-top: 32px; transform: translateX(-21px);">
        <a href="#try-it-out" class="ledger-btn">LAUNCH</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section 4: Try It Out (white background) -->
  <section id="try-it-out" class="w-full" style="background-color: var(--color-bg-white);">
    <div class="mx-auto px-4" style="max-width: 1012px; padding-top: 39px;">
      <h2 class="ledger-h2" style="font-size: 40px; line-height: 48px;">TRY IT OUT</h2>
      <div class="flex justify-center" style="margin-top: 47px; transform: translateX(46px);">
        <iframe
          src="https://www-impactcollectiv-com.filesusr.com/html/b550da_f7b0728e4bfb65ee6e43d0bd259ee51e.html"
          style="width: 734px; max-width: 100%; height: 865px; border: none; display: block;"
          title="Lend Ledger App"
        ></iframe>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Base>

<style>
  .ledger-h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-primary);
    font-size: 56px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 65px;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--color-accent-lend);
  }
  .ledger-subtitle {
    font-family: var(--font-primary);
    font-size: 24px;
    line-height: 34px;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--color-text-body);
    margin-top: 12px;
  }
  .ledger-h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-primary);
    font-size: 38px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 44px;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--color-accent-lend);
  }
  .ledger-rule {
    width: 30px;
    height: 3px;
    background: #000000;
    margin: 12px auto 0;
  }
  .ledger-body {
    font-family: var(--font-primary);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 24px;
    color: var(--color-text-body);
  }
  .ledger-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 142px;
    height: 45px;
    background: #3f7652;
    color: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 50px;
    font-family: var(--font-primary);
    font-size: 15px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .ledger-h1 {
      font-size: 40px;
      line-height: 48px;
    }
    .ledger-body,
    .ledger-btn,
    #try-it-out .flex,
    section .flex {
      transform: none !important;
    }
  }
</style>
